Subject: [PATCH] CP-T7.3: add ignored actual queue allocation diagnostic

Count cumulative successful Rust/System layout requests around bounded and linked channel constructors using the private scheduler Queued type. Keep the same pre-reserved endpoint vector through before/held/after-drop snapshots and format only afterward. The allocator and fixture are cfg(test)-only; no production behavior is changed.

Validation: approved d132 native macOS arm64 cargo test -p hex-node --lib --locked cp_t7_3_actual_queued_channel_allocation_probe --no-run exited 0 (r90). The ignored probe was not executed; actual allocation/RSS/profiling and any optimization decision remain ROOT-owned.
